   CHECK: derive.pia:29:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
   CHECK: derive.pia:33:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
   CHECK: derive.pia:38:38: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
   CHECK: derive.pia:45:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
